日记本：https://mizjeannie.com/daybook&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Daybook for November 10, 2026: an illustrated Ten of Diamonds, the daily reading, three favored magical focuses and their supporting timing windows." height="1600" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af2ff6b958b1.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 11:26:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日运势 2026年11月10日</title><link>https://some.pics/6af2faa7baa21</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;今日对应 — 2026年11月10日&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;黄金 · 黄水晶 · 罗勒&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mizjeannie.com/almanac"&gt;在Miz Jeannie上规划这一天 →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Correspondences for November 10, 2026. Color: Gold — clarity, study, prosperity, success. Crystal: Citrine — prosperity, clarity, confidence, success. Herb: Basil (Ocimum basilicum) — prosperity, protection, love, success. The graphic also explains why each fits today's almanac context." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af2faa7baa21.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 11:06:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>手机捕捉阳光射线效果</title><link>https://some.pics/6af24633b95cc</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我的手机对着太阳产生了那种光线效果，大概持续了一秒钟才聚焦，所以我试了大概5次才捕捉到那一瞬间，终于成功了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="a large tree with yellow/orange leaves and the sun is peeking through a pine tree" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af24633b95cc.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 22:16:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>收到Chibird新书</title><link>https://some.pics/6af24342a207a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;收到了Chibird的《坏日子不会永远持续》这本书！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A small blue hardcover book with cute yellow illustrated birds under a red umbrella, sun and clouds." height="961" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/binarydigit/6af24342a207a.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://binarydigit.some.pics"&gt;@binarydigit&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 22:03:49 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>无需标签的巫术</title><link>https://some.pics/6af23183a0cae</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你的巫术不需要标签。如果你喜欢解读卡牌，也喜欢种植草药用于施法，你不必非要选一个能解释这种组合的头衔。你可以追随这些兴趣，而不必先给它们命名。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted storybook witch tending rosemary in a charcoal-framed cliffside greenhouse, with cards on a wooden bench, muted rose floor tiles, and towering amethyst crystals beyond the glass. Ivory serif lettering curves across the stone arch, and a gold botanical emblem sits at bottom-right. Text: Your witchcraft doesn't need a label. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af23183a0cae.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 20:48:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>精彩但稍晚</title><link>https://some.pics/6af21cc5c6fda</link><description>&lt;p&gt;太棒了，只是有点晚&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Groene sloep in een groen kommetje op een bruine tafel" height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/simondh/6af21cc5c6fda.jpg" width="4000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://simondh.some.pics"&gt;@simondh&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 19:19:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>荷兰庆祝素食豌豆汤</title><link>https://some.pics/6af20359b3a80</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一个月后我又有了一个灶台，做素食豌豆汤来庆祝……&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Vuur met pan en iets groens erin" height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/simondh/6af20359b3a80.jpg" width="4000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://simondh.some.pics"&gt;@simondh&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 17:31:26 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>